    {
      "directNodeIds": [
        "cnm_205",
        "cnm_206",
        "cnm_203",
        "cnm_207"
      ],
      "explanation": "The two points give \\(k=-2\\) and \\(b=4\\), so \\(y=-2x+4\\). Setting \\(y=0\\) gives \\(x=2\\). Since \\(k<0\\), when \\(y>0\\), \\(x<2\\), so \\(a=2\\).",
